A delimiter after an underscore or slash opens only when that one pairs

```
_*x* q

_/x/ q

/_x_ q

_~x~ q

_=x= q
.
<p>_*x* q</p>
<p>_/x/ q</p>
<p>/_x_ q</p>
<p>_~x~ q</p>
<p>_=x= q</p>
```

```
a _*x* q
.
<p>a _*x* q</p>
```

```
_*x*_ q

/_x_/ q

_*x* y_ q
.
<p><u><strong>x</strong></u> q</p>
<p><em><u>x</u></em> q</p>
<p><u><strong>x</strong> y</u> q</p>
```

```
_*{*x*} q
.
<p>_*<strong>x</strong> q</p>
```

```
![p](p.png)
^ Figure _*# x* q
.
<figure>
  <img src="p.png" alt="p">
  <figcaption>Figure _*1 x* q</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
_*x* \"'a' "
.
<p>_*x* "’a’ “</p>
```
